{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01429",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.0,
      "end_seconds": 2.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Welcome. Make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.74,
      "end_seconds": 7.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Afternoon, you know, is this seat fine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.73,
      "end_seconds": 11.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "You came on your own today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.03,
      "end_seconds": 15.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Yes, I managed on my own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.75,
      "end_seconds": 20.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "So what can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.55,
      "end_seconds": 26.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "Doctor, it's irregular periods. It's getting on my nerves now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.1,
      "end_seconds": 34.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.22,
      "end_seconds": 38.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "For one week, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.1,
      "end_seconds": 43.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "How strong would you say it is?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.59,
      "end_seconds": 46.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "Severe, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.86,
      "end_seconds": 49.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.37,
      "end_seconds": 66.85,
      "duration_seconds": 16.48,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get acne as well. The acne? That's been for two weeks. With acne, I'd call it severe. I've been putting on weight too, for six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.97,
      "end_seconds": 72.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Have you noticed milky nipple discharge, headaches or palpitations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.22,
      "end_seconds": 75.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "No, not a single one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.01,
      "end_seconds": 80.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.41,
      "end_seconds": 83.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.96,
      "end_seconds": 87.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "How are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.96,
      "end_seconds": 90.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "No, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.67,
      "end_seconds": 94.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Have you ever had an operation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.39,
      "end_seconds": 102.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.59,
      "text": "Yes, I had a bunion operation, six years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.78,
      "end_seconds": 116.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.98,
      "end_seconds": 126.78,
      "duration_seconds": 8.8,
      "text": "I take Thyronorm, 50 micrograms, every morning. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.68,
      "end_seconds": 133.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "Right, is there anything relevant on the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.15,
      "end_seconds": 140.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "My mother has an underactive thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.81,
      "end_seconds": 144.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.12,
      "end_seconds": 147.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Yes, an underactive thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.45,
      "end_seconds": 152.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.46,
      "end_seconds": 158.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.69,
      "end_seconds": 162.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.78,
      "end_seconds": 177.0,
      "duration_seconds": 12.22,
      "text": "I've never touched a cigarette. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. I do a yoga class on Thursdays. My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.92,
      "end_seconds": 181.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.88,
      "end_seconds": 193.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.39,
      "end_seconds": 220.42,
      "duration_seconds": 7.03,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 109 over 77, saturation 99 percent, temperature is 36.5 degrees, pulse 85."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.55,
      "end_seconds": 223.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.03,
      "end_seconds": 227.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "That's fine, I'll explain it soon."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.98,
      "end_seconds": 232.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Right, may I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.49,
      "end_seconds": 236.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.27,
      "end_seconds": 264.12,
      "duration_seconds": 9.85,
      "text": "Your weight is up a little, and there is acne on the jaw and some coarse hairs on the chin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.83,
      "end_seconds": 269.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "All finished, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.61,
      "end_seconds": 287.28,
      "duration_seconds": 9.67,
      "text": "From what you've told me and what I found, I think we're dealing with polycystic ovary syndrome at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 288.27,
      "end_seconds": 289.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "Is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.43,
      "end_seconds": 317.59,
      "duration_seconds": 26.16,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with polycystic ovary syndrome do well once it's treated properly. I'm going to order a pelvic ultrasound, for irregular periods. I think a thyroid test makes sense here, for irregular periods. Let's use metformin, 500 milligrams, twice a day with food, long term. That's for polycystic ovaries. Regular exercise and a lower-sugar diet help the periods settle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 318.24,
      "end_seconds": 323.38,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "text": "Could I get hormone blood tests done? A friend had it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.48,
      "end_seconds": 339.92,
      "duration_seconds": 14.44,
      "text": "I wouldn't order it today. If anything changes, we'll reconsider. Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.86,
      "end_seconds": 343.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Thank you, that's clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.28,
      "end_seconds": 349.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 351.0,
      "end_seconds": 353.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 355.15,
      "end_seconds": 356.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}